/-!
# A275666

Multisets of numbers such that the sum of reciprocals is 1 and each element e occurs at most lpf(e) - 1 times.

The 82 terms known to OEIS, indexed from `1`.

Skeleton generated by `lake exe oeis-gen`; every declaration is a `sorry` placeholder.
-/

namespace A275666

/-- Known terms of `flat`, starting at index `1`. -/
def flatData : List flatRetType :=
